  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 316.06 Filing of Disclosure Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 316.06 titled “Scope of Disclosure; Release Authorization”\n\nThe only filing affecting Env-Sw 314.04 through Env-Sw 314.12 since Document #8460-B, effective 10-28-05, was Document #10595, effective 7-1-14. These rules did not expire on 7-1-24 but were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until deleted by Document #14124, effective 11-23-24.\n\nThe filings affecting the former Env-Sw 316.06 included the following:\n\n(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)\n\n#8460-B, effective 10-28-05\n\n#10595, effective 7-1-14\n\n(See also Revision Note at part heading for Env-Sw 316 about forms in Document #13192 and Document #13193)\n\n#13386, effective 5-26-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw300.html"
